# ---- Large / regenerable binaries — kept out of git (GitHub's 100 MB hard limit) ----
# A fresh `git clone` still gets everything needed to run the browser sim and to
# start the Colab M4 pipeline (scene grids, notebooks, smoke ONNX, outdoor demo
# tile, cached volumes). Only multi-GB regenerable artifacts stay out.

# Trained PyTorch checkpoints live on Drive during Colab; do not commit.
*.pt
*.pth

# ONNX models are ignored by default (can be large). The browser surrogate at the
# fixed deploy path MUST clone with the repo — allow-list it explicitly so
# `git add SIM3D/web/pl_unet3d.onnx` after Colab export is not silently skipped.
*.onnx
!Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/web/pl_unet3d.onnx
!SIM3D/web/pl_unet3d.onnx

# Dataset shard *volumes* (~GB). Meta sidecars are ignored the same way.
# Do NOT use a blanket `*.npz` — that also hides small non-dataset archives.
Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/dataset/shard_*.npy
Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/dataset/shard_*_meta.npz
Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/dataset/*.part
# 2-D pipeline shards (same rule)
Physics Engine/2D/SIM/dataset/shard_*.npz
Physics Engine/2D/SIM/dataset/*.part

# Outdoor FULL city voxel grids — ~350 MB; regenerate with voxelize_city.py.
# The committed demo tile under city_demo/ is NOT ignored (Outdoor mode works offline).
Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/city/

# Diffraction relay cache — ~376 MB; rebuilt on first solve (~75 s).
Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/cache/

# Colab checkpoint dir contents except the human-readable train report
Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/checkpoints/*
!Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/checkpoints/.gitkeep
!Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/checkpoints/train_report.json

# ---- Large local working data — NOT committable ----
# GitHub rejects any single file over 100 MB at the pre-receive hook, and
# Sandbox_Version_3D_Simulation_v1.obj/ holds a 328.77 MB .obj. These are listed
# explicitly so VSCode's "Stage All Changes" cannot sweep them into a commit that
# is then unpushable — which has already happened once.
FCC_Walk_Outdoor_Indoor_Full/
Sandbox_Version_3D_Simulation_v1.obj/
Sandbox_Version_3D_Simulation_1.obj/

# Cloned helper repos — check these out separately, they are not part of this project
claude-colab-main/
colab-mcp-main/

# Local development virtualenv (created by the environment update script)
.venv/

# ---- OS / Python junk ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# scene_v1_backup/ — pre-M0.4 grid, kept locally for rollback (not versioned)
Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/scene_v1_backup/

# Indoor OSM basemap (PR #25): a large, per-machine generated raster. Regenerate with
# `python3 scripts/prepare_indoor_basemap.py`. The live (Leaflet) path needs no file.
Data/basemap_image.js
